@startuml dji_mock_external
title dji_mock component - external interactions
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "apps/dji_mock" as dji_mock
component "config/urls.py\n/__mock-dji__/" as config_urls
component "config/settings.py\nENABLE_DJI_MOCK_SERVER" as settings
component "apps/dji_cloud.gateway\nHTTP client can target\nmock base_url" as dji_gateway
actor "local/test HTTP client" as test_client

config_urls --> dji_mock : mounts mock route
dji_mock --> settings : checks ENABLE_DJI_MOCK_SERVER\nand 404s when disabled
test_client --> dji_mock : DJI-like HTTP API
dji_gateway --> dji_mock : optional upstream target\nfor local/test flows

@enduml
